## Binance Futures credentials
# For demo/paper trading: generate keys at https://demo.binance.com (API Management).
# For mainnet: generate keys at https://www.binance.com (API Management).
# NOTE: demo keys and mainnet keys are NOT interchangeable.
BINANCE_API_KEY=your_api_key_here
BINANCE_API_SECRET=your_api_secret_here

## Environment
# true  → Demo Trading (demo.binance.com) — safe, uses fake balance.
# false → Mainnet — real money. Use with care.
# If omitted, the bot defaults to testnet=True (demo) in code.
BINANCE_TESTNET=true

